---
// Denied / results disclaimer under "When the answer is no" (desktop 243:1033, mobile 244:989): 24px navy rule + small text.
---
<p class="m-0 w-full flex items-start gap-[12px] lg:items-center lg:gap-[16px]" data-node="243:1033" data-node-m="244:989">
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-[24px] h-px bg-navy shrink-0"></span>
  <span class="bs-dden__disc flex-1 text-ink" data-node="243:1035" data-node-m="244:991">Results reflect specific losses and policies. Past results don't guarantee a similar outcome.</span>
</p>
<style is:global>
  .bs-dden__disc { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .bs-dden__disc { font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; } }
</style>
